{"text":"And then all my insecurities just came right in front of my face. I mean, what if the audition was a fluke? After all, she was coaching me through the whole thing. And what do I really know about acting? You know, I mean, I meet my classmates and they are this talented group of people who had gotten their bachelors in acting or they had the roles that I never had. Their resumes look great. Mine had sheep number two, narrator, a singing pirate in the background, and some other things. So I really got insecure and I really let it get the best of me. My three years in grad school were the hardest years of my life because I got in the way of myself. So what I would say to you is number one, love yourself, nurture yourself. Even when I was in Switzerland and Kenya and Ethiopia, I was usually in settings where I was one of the few black girls and it was made very apparent to me that I wasn't like a whole bunch of other people and it affected me. I mean, my parents would affirm me, but I was like, yeah, they're my parents. They don't count. You know, they have to say that. So I took them for granted and I gave more weight to what other people thought about me. Don't do that.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.68},{"text":"then","start":0.68,"end":0.86},{"text":"all","start":0.86,"end":1.14},{"text":"my","start":1.14,"end":1.36},{"text":"insecurities","start":1.36,"end":2.02},{"text":"just","start":2.02,"end":2.4},{"text":"came","start":2.4,"end":2.66},{"text":"right","start":2.66,"end":2.96},{"text":"in","start":2.96,"end":3.14},{"text":"front","start":3.14,"end":3.28},{"text":"of","start":3.28,"end":3.38},{"text":"my","start":3.38,"end":3.5},{"text":"face","start":3.5,"end":3.88,"punct":"."},{"text":"I","start":4.34,"end":4.38},{"text":"mean","start":4.38,"end":4.46,"punct":","},{"text":"what","start":4.54,"end":4.66},{"text":"if","start":4.66,"end":4.8},{"text":"the","start":4.8,"end":4.9},{"text":"audition","start":4.9,"end":5.16},{"text":"was","start"